                           <description>The last write protection violation source is reported in TC_SSRx.WPVSRC and the last software control error type is reported in TC_SSRx.SWETYP. The TC_SRx.SECE flag is set at the first error occurrence within a series.</description>
                           <value>0</value>
                        </enumeratedValue>
                        <enumeratedValue>
                           <name>FIRSTE_1</name>
                           <description>Only the first write protection violation source is reported in TC_SSRx.WPVSRC and only the first software control error type is reported in TC_SSRx.SWETYP. The TC_SRx.SECE flag is set at the first error occurrence within a series.</description>
                           <value>1</value>
                        </enumeratedValue>
                     </enumeratedValues>
